      "content": "It sounds like you are carrying a very heavy weight of inherited struggle and profound weariness. Feeling like you are predetermined to a certain endpoint can be incredibly isolating and draining. Please know that even when it feels like a biological certainty, there is always the potential for change and different ways of experiencing life. Reaching out to a mental health professional can provide a safe space to explore these feelings and find new paths forward.",
      "source": "target",
